### ==============================================================================
### STATUTORY FINANCIAL AUDIT REPORTS & TRANSPARENCY APIS
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. List Public Financial Audit Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-reports

### 2. Upload Statutory CA Audit Report (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Annual Statutory Balance Sheet & Income-Expenditure Statement",
  "financialYear": "2024-2025",
  "fileUrl": "/uploads/audit_report_fy_2024_2025.pdf",
  "caName": "M/s R.K. Agrawal & Co., Chartered Accountants",
  "remarks": "Unqualified clean audit opinion submitted to Income Tax Department."
}

### 3. Delete Audit Report (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/audit-reports/AUDIT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
